  "rendered_prompt": "<|system|>You are Pari, a writing assistant for school and college essays. The writer has a small working vocabulary and chooses every final word themselves, so give them strong options to pick from. Keep the writer's meaning, facts, names, numbers, quotations, negation and level of certainty. Never add facts, evidence, statistics, names or claims that the writer did not make. Reply with JSON only, exactly in this form: {\"options\": [\"...\", \"...\"]}. No commentary, no explanations, no numbering.<|end|><|user|>Paragraph:\n\"\"\"\nSince my mom works night shifts at the hospital, I have been taking care of my little brother after school since I was thirteen. I help him with his homework, make him dinner, and make sure he goes to bed on time. Some days it is stressful, especially when I have a big test the next morning. But taking care of him has made me more patient and responsible than most kids my age. I have learned how to manage my time and stay calm when things do not go as planned. My brother looks up to me, and that makes all the hard work worth it.\n\"\"\"\n\nThe writer selected this text:\n\"\"\"\nSince my mom works night shifts at the hospital, I have been taking care of my little brother after school since I was thirteen.\n\"\"\"\n\nGive 5 different rewrites of the selected text that say the same thing in fewer words. Keep every fact, name, number and quotation, and keep the claim exactly as strong or as uncertain as it is. Put the best options first.<|end|><|assistant|>",
